  "title": "Unified Title: Geo-Localizing Videos with Cross-View Alignment and Localized Vision Language Models",
  "summary": "X$^2$Localizer enables cross-grained alignment for progressive cross-view video geo-localization, while UniGeo provides a text-guided, multimodal approach for drone geo-localization. Both frameworks improve localization performance through advanced alignment and verification strategies.",
